A nightly data load

The `Scheduler` starts the `Extract job`, with the label `start`. The
`Extract job` reads the `Sales database` with the label `read`, and writes
files to the `Data lake` with the label `write`. The `Load job` reads the
`Data lake` with the label `read`, and writes to the `Warehouse` with the label
`write`. The `Dashboard` reads the `Warehouse`, with the label `read`.
---
Scheduler -> Extract job: start
Extract job -> Sales database: read
Extract job -> Data lake: write
Load job -> Data lake: read
Load job -> Warehouse: write
Dashboard -> Warehouse: read
